rd, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, June to July ran 188% of normal while November to December ran 43%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 29% of normal on the middle. Grid 25933 had its driest year in 2022 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
